## 1. Free Usage
You may use, modify, and distribute this engine freely for personal, educational, or commercial projects.

---

## 2. Revenue Sharing
If your **gross revenue from any single product** developed with RealEngine exceeds **$100,000 USD**, you agree to pay **AGS Software a 2% royalty** on revenue exceeding $100,000.

### 2.1 Excluded Income
The following **do NOT count as revenue** for royalty purposes:
- Crowdfunding (e.g. Kickstarter, Indiegogo) unless directly tied to delivery of a copy of the product
- Community support or subscriptions (e.g. Patreon, Ko-fi) not tied to guaranteed delivery of the product
- Donations, grants, or public funding not tied to commercial sales
- Revenue unrelated to the product (e.g. merchandise, consulting)

### 2.2 Included Revenue
The 2% royalty applies only to:
- Direct game or application sales
- In-app purchases
- Paid downloadable content (DLC)
- Commercial licenses or subscriptions to the product

---

## 3. Payment Terms
Royalties must be reported and paid **monthly**, at the end of each calendar month, **once your product surpasses $100,000 in gross revenue**.

---

## 4. Reporting
You are responsible for tracking and reporting revenue honestly. AGS Software may request records for audit purposes.

---

## 5. Future License Changes
AGS Software reserves the right to update or modify this license at any time.

> **However, any project developed using a version of RealEngine released under this license will continue to follow the terms of this license, even if the license changes in the future.**  
This means games made with current or earlier versions of RealEngine are **grandfathered** and protected from future license changes.

